  "details": "I think a great feature would be to minimize the size of nameplates. They're so big and distracting, it would be nice to have more options than just on or off. The game feels 100 times better with them off, but then you run into the trouble of not recognizing your pals. If you could give us a 3rd option instead of on or off, maybe make it very small and not glowing above everyone's head? Like maybe even more transparent and on the floor instead of floating.",
